{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devil Meat</strong> is a multi-ending roguelite adventure where you, a mercenary, are captured by the church and forced to take part in a fanatical saint's ascension ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically combine blessings to grow stronger, hunt as many demons as possible, and feed their flesh to the saint. In the end, nervously witness the eerie spectacle of her rebirth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/30b432a12acf42b42c8d69fea3dc3792.poster.avif?t=1757722681\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/30b432a12acf42b42c8d69fea3dc3792.webm?t=1757722681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/30b432a12acf42b42c8d69fea3dc3792.mp4?t=1757722681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Demon Flesh</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve ascension, countless unholy flesh is required. Slaughter the demons sleeping deep within the dungeon and devise strategies to explore more efficiently. The deeper you go, the more grotesque and valuable flesh awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/dba836b8d7650616bf4ce5444651b78c.poster.avif?t=1757722681\" width=598 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/dba836b8d7650616bf4ce5444651b78c.webm?t=1757722681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/dba836b8d7650616bf4ce5444651b78c.mp4?t=1757722681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help the Saint</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veronica is a girl consumed by blind faith, waiting for your help to ascend to the heavens. Select and feed her as much demon flesh as possible. In return for your devotion, she will grant you powerful blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/51439da0aa4d2eb38d840fd6cb456882.avif?t=1757722681\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the ritual ends, you and the saint will face multiple possible endings. Will her ascension succeed, or will she incur the wrath of the god?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Contents</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 dungeons filled with monsters that demand strategic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine about 50 blessings from the Saint to build unique strategies\u2014melee, ranged, defense-focused, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter bizarre yet charming NPCs: the Saint, a parrot, an apple tree</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665960?t=1757722681","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/99857d87eb3c1e5f9659b8dff7ddc4320386e7cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757722681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/5cbcad1337d7a23f6c5600201d39f294d041fcec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757722681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/5cbcad1337d7a23f6c5600201d39f294d041fcec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757722681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devil Meat</strong> is a multi-ending roguelite adventure where you, a mercenary, are captured by the church and forced to take part in a fanatical saint's ascension ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically combine blessings to grow stronger, hunt as many demons as possible, and feed their flesh to the saint. In the end, nervously witness the eerie spectacle of her rebirth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/30b432a12acf42b42c8d69fea3dc3792.poster.avif?t=1757722681\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/30b432a12acf42b42c8d69fea3dc3792.webm?t=1757722681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/30b432a12acf42b42c8d69fea3dc3792.mp4?t=1757722681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Demon Flesh</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve ascension, countless unholy flesh is required. Slaughter the demons sleeping deep within the dungeon and devise strategies to explore more efficiently. The deeper you go, the more grotesque and valuable flesh awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/dba836b8d7650616bf4ce5444651b78c.poster.avif?t=1757722681\" width=598 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/dba836b8d7650616bf4ce5444651b78c.webm?t=1757722681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/dba836b8d7650616bf4ce5444651b78c.mp4?t=1757722681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help the Saint</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veronica is a girl consumed by blind faith, waiting for your help to ascend to the heavens. Select and feed her as much demon flesh as possible. In return for your devotion, she will grant you powerful blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/extras/51439da0aa4d2eb38d840fd6cb456882.avif?t=1757722681\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the ritual ends, you and the saint will face multiple possible endings. Will her ascension succeed, or will she incur the wrath of the god?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Contents</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 dungeons filled with monsters that demand strategic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine about 50 blessings from the Saint to build unique strategies\u2014melee, ranged, defense-focused, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter bizarre yet charming NPCs: the Saint, a parrot, an apple tree</p></li></ul>","developers":["Easyroad"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3595730","name":"Devil Meat"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665960/618b6731ee4fbe80fbbb41f6910e71802b55723a/header.jpg