hether you will survive\u2014is entirely up to you.","steam_appid":3665960,"support_info":{"email":"xenongames552@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Korean, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","type":"demo","website":null}